# Study packs.
# Packs are generated from your own course material. The COMPX310 and COMPX361
# packs ship, so the deployed app has something to open on first load; anything
# else you generate stays local. To ship another, add a negation line.
public/packs/*
!public/packs/README.md
!public/packs/index.json
!public/packs/compx310-test1/
!public/packs/compx361-test1/
